; BQ40Z50 Temperature Calibration Sequence (Based on EV2300 Log)

; 1. Request DAStatus2
B 0x44 0x72 0x00
X 10

; 2. Read DAStatus2
A 0x44 10 1

; 3. Request Current (0x0A) - As per log
RW 0x0A
X 10

; 4. Request DAStatus2 (2nd time)
B 0x44 0x72 0x00
X 10

; 5. Read DAStatus2 (2nd time)
A 0x44 10 1

; 6. Request Current (0x0A) - As per log
RW 0x0A
X 10

; 7. Save Calibration Data (updates 0x4000 block)
; The S command automatically reads 0x4000, updates it, and writes it back.
S 0x4000
X 250

; 8. Disable RAW ADC
W 0x00 0xF080
X 55

; 9. Check ManufacturingStatus (CAL_EN 0 check)
B 0x44 0x57 0x00
X 10
R 0x44
